---
// FAQ Section — Collapsible accordion
---

<section class="section faq" id="faq">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header reveal">
      <span class="section-label">常见问题</span>
      <h2 class="section-title">你可能想问的</h2>
      <p class="section-desc">
        在正式沟通之前，先看看这些高频问题能不能解答你的疑惑。
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="faq-list reveal reveal-delay-1">
      <div class="faq-item card">
        <button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-1">
          <span>AI 方案适合小公司吗？我们团队只有几个人。</span>
          <svg class="faq-icon" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M5 8l5 5 5-5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
          </svg>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-answer" id="faq-1" aria-hidden="true">
          <p>小团队反而是最受益的。大公司有预算堆人力，你没有——但 AI 可以帮你拉平这个差距。知识库方案一个人就能用，口播工作流适合 1-3 人的内容团队。方案本身就是按「最小可用」设计的，不是给大厂定制的。</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item card">
        <button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-2">
          <span>数据安全怎么保障？本地模型方案是什么意思？</span>
          <svg class="faq-icon" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M5 8l5 5 5-5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
          </svg>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-answer" id="faq-2" aria-hidden="true">
          <p>本地模型方案是指大模型跑在你自己的电脑或服务器上，数据不出本地网络。适合律所、金融、医疗等对数据合规有要求的场景。普通方案用的是云端 API（如 Claude、GPT），数据传输加密，不用于训练，但确实经过第三方服务器。看你行业的合规要求选方案。</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item card">
        <button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-3">
          <span>交付周期大概多久？</span>
          <svg class="faq-icon" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M5 8l5 5 5-5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
          </svg>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-answer" id="faq-3" aria-hidden="true">
          <p>知识库方案：1-2 周。本地模型方案：2-3 周。口播工作流：2-4 周（含调试期）。这是从签约到交付成品的时间，不含前期沟通和需求确认。急单可以加急，但不建议——仓促上线的方案用不起来。</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item card">
        <button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-4">
          <span>我对 AI 完全不懂，能用吗？</span>
          <svg class="faq-icon" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M5 8l5 5 5-5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
          </svg>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-answer" id="faq-4" aria-hidden="true">
          <p>我的交付物里包含使用手册和培训，目标是让你自己能用、能改、能迭代。不是丢一个工具给你就不管了。很多客户一开始也是零基础，用起来之后反而比技术团队更会玩——因为他们更懂自己的业务场景。</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item card">
        <button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-5">
          <span>价格怎么算？</span>
          <svg class="faq-icon" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M5 8l5 5 5-5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
          </svg>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-answer" id="faq-5" aria-hidden="true">
          <p>每套方案的复杂度不同，没法一口价。简单说：知识库方案最亲民，本地模型方案看部署规模，口播工作流看平台数量和定制程度。建议先聊需求，我出方案和报价，你觉得合适再推进。不收咨询费。</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item card">
        <button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-6">
          <span>交付之后还有售后吗？</span>
          <svg class="faq-icon" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M5 8l5 5 5-5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
          </svg>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-answer" id="faq-6" aria-hidden="true">
          <p>有。交付后 30 天内免费答疑和小调整。之后如果需要深度迭代或新功能，可以按次或按月合作。我不做一锤子买卖——你用得好，才会介绍给其他人。</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .faq {
    background: var(--bg-surface);
  }

  .faq-list {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .faq-item {
    padding: 0;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .faq-question {
    width: 100%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 16px;
    padding: 24px 28px;
    background: none;
    border: none;
    cursor: pointer;
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    text-align: left;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    transition: color 0.3s var(--ease-out);
  }

  .faq-question:hover {
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .faq-icon {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    transition: transform 0.3s var(--ease-out), color 0.3s var(--ease-out);
  }

  .faq-item.open .faq-icon {
    transform: rotate(180deg);
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .faq-answer {
    max-height: 0;
    overflow: hidden;
    transition: max-height 0.4s var(--ease-out), padding 0.4s var(--ease-out);
    padding: 0 28px;
  }

  .faq-item.open .faq-answer {
    max-height: 300px;
    padding: 0 28px 24px;
  }

  .faq-answer p {
    font-size: 15px;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .faq-question {
      font-size: 15px;
      padding: 20px 20px;
    }

    .faq-answer {
      padding: 0 20px;
    }

    .faq-item.open .faq-answer {
      padding: 0 20px 20px;
    }
  }
</style>

<script>
  document.querySelectorAll('.faq-question').forEach((btn) => {
    btn.addEventListener('click', () => {
      const item = btn.closest('.faq-item');
      const answer = item?.querySelector('.faq-answer');
      const isOpen = item?.classList.contains('open');

      // Close all others
      document.querySelectorAll('.faq-item.open').forEach((openItem) => {
        if (openItem !== item) {
          openItem.classList.remove('open');
          openItem.querySelector('.faq-question')?.setAttribute('aria-expanded', 'false');
          openItem.querySelector('.faq-answer')?.setAttribute('aria-hidden', 'true');
        }
      });

      // Toggle current
      item?.classList.toggle('open');
      btn.setAttribute('aria-expanded', isOpen ? 'false' : 'true');
      answer?.setAttribute('aria-hidden', isOpen ? 'true' : 'false');
    });

    // Keyboard support — Escape to close
    btn.addEventListener('keydown', (e) => {
      if (e.key === 'Escape') {
        const item = btn.closest('.faq-item');
        if (item?.classList.contains('open')) {
          item.classList.remove('open');
          btn.setAttribute('aria-expanded', 'false');
          item.querySelector('.faq-answer')?.setAttribute('aria-hidden', 'true');
        }
      }
    });
  });
</script>
